ift"},"references":{"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/SpaceSemanticToken":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SpaceSemanticToken","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/spacesemantictoken","abstract":[{"text":"Basically a space semantic token is a _ raw token, it has the same final type, to keep grammar clean and clear with design system grammar.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpaceSemanticToken"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpaceSemanticToken"}],"title":"SpaceSemanticToken"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSText"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllTypographyComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TypographyComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetypographycomponenttokensprovider"},"ic_theme_orange.p